                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The trooper carries a grenade</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The trooper Interacts to draw their grenade and throw it up to 30 feet. The grenade then explodes in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10]. Creatures within the burst take @Damage[8d10[poison]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:36|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:sickened] save). On a failure, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure).</p>"
                },
