                "category": "offensive",
                "deathNote": true,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The trooper carries a grenade and gains the Rad Grenade ability. If the grenade is in the trooper's possession when the trooper dies, the grenade detonates in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] centered on the trooper.</p>\n<p><strong>Rad Grenade</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (radiation)</p>\n<p>@Embed[Actor.1qRP8O4LLV3oQ4vQ.Item.jOpQx9ou5hMIOCQa inline]</p>"
